        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana EP475, Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull installs in the edge of the door, to pull a sliding door out of its pocket. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Edge Pull measures 4\" high by 3/4\" wide. Its narrow width allows for installation on narrow or standard 1-3/8\" wide doors. A spring loaded pull lever, it automatically returns to a position that is flush with the plate when released. It includes matching finish installation screws and is available in 12 great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"270\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-EP475-Spceifications.gif?v=1704354708\" width=\"270\" height=\"235\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana EP475 Solid Brass Pocket Door Edge Pull Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana EP475 Door Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Holes Center to Center: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Lever Opening: 39 Degrees</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EP475.pdf?v=1704262161\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana EP475 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch Pocket Door Edge Pull | Deltana EP475",
                "description": "Solid Brass Pocket Door Edge Pull, Deltana EP475 - This door pull installs in the edge of the door, to pull a sliding door out of its pocket. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Edge Pull measures 4 inches high by 3/4 inches wide. Its narrow width allows for installation on narrow or standard 1-3/8 inch wide doors. A spring loaded pull lever, it automatically returns to a position that is flush with the plate when released. It includes matching finish installation screws and is available in 12 great finishes. ",
